comments={'privacy_closed_arrival':'Whole proposed kit view shows a calm opaque arrival field, stable feet and rod; the actual platform plateau is hidden. The trolley remains visible to the side, illustrating the explicitly limited privacy field.','privacy_open_arrival':'At the identical camera and lights the screen nests left and the actual platform is revealed. Frame and feet are unchanged; this compares two static exported states of one original design.','clinical_working_side':'Ordinary-height side view shows the distinct roles and disjoint placements of wash/supply bay, neutral three-pad platform, supply trolley and privacy screen. Empty intervening floor remains visible without implying an original room or accessible route.','support_contact_view':'Intentional ordinary-eye close view shows three separate, equal contact pads and clipped deck edges, with no body or anatomical/species fit inference. Front and support legs are intentionally outside this crop.','wash_work_view':'Intentional1.65m close view clearly shows the actual bowl recess and closed drain cap, separate control faces and dry rim; higher clinical-detail views are not needed to infer the recess from this view.'};rows=[]
